# 保留源码、文档和筛选后的实验记录；忽略不删除本机文件。
# 原始课程输入由使用者自行准备。
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm

# 实验目录只收录报告Markdown。结果JSON、过程记录、模型、完整调度与逐轮日志全部留在本机。
# 2026-10-22 收紧：此前的 summary.json / config.json / *history*.json / events.jsonl /
# rounds.jsonl / csv / png 允许规则已移除，单个 summary.json 曾达 4.57 MB。
/problem2/results/**/*
!/problem2/results/**/
!/problem2/results/**/*.md

# 仅保留Case 1及Case 2最好解这两份完整调度。
!/problem2/results/exact_case1/run01/gurobi/result.json
!/problem2/results/exact_case1/run01/gurobi/schedule.csv
!/problem2/results/exact_case1/run01/gurobi/gantt.svg
!/problem2/results/overnight_windows/run01/width9/seed23/best/result.json
!/problem2/results/overnight_windows/run01/width9/seed23/best/schedule.csv
!/problem2/results/overnight_windows/run01/width9/seed23/best/gantt.svg

# 即使名称符合允许规则，历史源码快照仍全部排除。
/problem2/results/**/source/
/problem2/results/**/src/
/problem2/results/**/snapshot/
/problem2/results/**/snapshots/
/problem2/results/**/source_snapshot/
/problem2/results/**/source_snapshots/
/.backups/
